{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0164_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1df05c894d2bc00f436771cf304b6cd3a1f8517c9d4f46e208fc01dba7bb5207", "ja": "（桃子がブログを更新していた。\n新しい衣装、だいぶ気に入ってるみたいだ）", "zh": "（桃子更新了博客。\n看来她相当喜欢新服装）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0164_1001_049mom", "source_sha256": "5b3c1ecc70604cf63b848c41e9c7feda5f5ff31a39e21f0315b483c8d9680eae", "ja": "ふんふ～ん……ふふーん♪\nえへへ……カワイイ♪", "zh": "哼哼～……呼呼♪\n嘿嘿……好可爱♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0164_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4ae74d36c31f75668b2b669353d4b790fd41a6aa13ca4c044bcc6bc3eaf8ffd1", "ja": "ブログの更新お疲れさま、桃子。その衣装、\n喜んでもらえて良かったよ。うん、よく似合ってる。", "zh": "更新博客辛苦了，桃子。那套服装，\n你能喜欢真是太好了。嗯，非常适合你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0164_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "c931d2f4194f1638ce14835dec39716bdb512edf4c1c0f125a8b86ed00e0f148", "ja": "お疲れさま、お兄ちゃん。\nもう、そんな当たり前のことを言いに来たの？", "zh": "辛苦了，哥哥。  \n怎么，特意过来就为了说这种理所当然的话吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0164_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "a3ae7597c0e1dbfdf419b9226f0da0fe0777418ab65f70057beb554981603604", "ja": "だってこれは、桃子の衣装なんだから。\n桃子に似合うのは、当然でしょ？　えへへ♪", "zh": "因为这是桃子的服装嘛。\n适合桃子，不是理所当然的吗？嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0164_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "c4031ec9555f98e76cb838db30292c914ad730f6fe00934f2db1ce1bcf8952e7", "ja": "この衣装、遊園地のパレードにピッタリだよね。\nネコさんっぽいところも、すごくいい感じだし♪", "zh": "这套服装很适合游乐园的巡游，对吧。  \n像猫咪一样的设计也特别棒呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0164_1006_p", "source_sha256": "cb9f9ef613acf20828da7b69fa950500140dbb390c2413e521fd918fc37dda11", "ja": "そうか。やっぱり、マスコットのネコさんを\nイメージしたデザインにしてもらって、正解だったな。", "zh": "这样啊。果然，让他们设计成以吉祥物猫咪为灵感的服装，是正确的选择。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0164_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "f17585c107aff6fa2f15bd93dc4c47a4925aeb46c3ee393a806600cf71662f4a", "ja": "え？　これってもしかして、\nお兄ちゃんが考えた衣装なの？", "zh": "诶？这难道是哥哥设计的服装吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0164_1008_p", "source_sha256": "222d5e4f910025486ce3e3b0c5c9351060bc1346b488d1f293c6efb8cf4e604e", "ja": "いや、デザインを考えたわけじゃないけど……\nマスコットのネコさん、桃子が好きそうだなと思って。", "zh": "不，也不是我设计的……\n只是觉得吉祥物猫咪，桃子应该会喜欢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0164_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "52165365a727a6ffa667d5585ca03a1f812ad93f4f7dcee59e08b755d86efc27", "ja": "もう。お兄ちゃん、そういうのなんていうか知ってる？\n『公私混同』っていうんだよ。", "zh": "真是的。大哥哥，你知道这种情况叫什么吗？\n这就叫“公私不分”哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0164_1010_p", "source_sha256": "e76a78bf7c340b33a3cd56b8b6532c0fc750351ae7d8812d6c12bd14a4ab90cd", "ja": "いや、別に私情っていうわけじゃ……\nちゃんと遊園地のデザイナーさんの監修も入ってるし。", "zh": "没有，倒也不是出于私心……\n游乐园的设计师也是有好好监修过的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0164_1011_p", "source_sha256": "9f77684abb69f0679ab12038584c405ee738d2c52f5f4b8b6447ced48f2177ae", "ja": "遊園地のパレードに相応しくて、\n桃子に似合うものをって考えたら、そうなったんだ。", "zh": "考虑到要适合游乐园的巡游，又要适合桃子，就变成这样了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0164_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "5ba726171027ffec111b999c92b0bda1e09e77c594663ff73dfd24c8284709a8", "ja": "ふーん……そうなんだ。まあ、\nちゃんと考えてるなら、いいんだけど。", "zh": "嗯……原来是这样。只要你有认真考虑，那就行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0164_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "d4798675e5f8946ed23a205d3ed714796ef6ef00d6b4482bba6421001a779d26", "ja": "でも、桃子が好きだからって、安易にコンセプトに\nするのはダメだよ！　桃子たちは、プロなんだから。", "zh": "但是，不能因为喜欢桃子，就轻易把这个当成概念哦！桃子可是专业人士。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0164_1014_049mom", "source_sha256": "071283c9ccd2bbe377d16d4f4f5032e82cf071deb170afa65151a568bf432337", "ja": "プロはまず、見てくれるファンのみんなのことを\n考えなきゃ。桃子たちのことは、その次でしょ？", "zh": "专业偶像首先得考虑来看我们的粉丝们。桃子她们的事，要放在那之后，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0164_1015_p", "source_sha256": "ec9a6996ac1473cf91b7dbd8fda8943e9d45195e9396c38361f5f0f769000afe", "ja": "もちろん考えたよ。桃子は今回、見に来てくれる\nファンの人達が、一番喜んでくれる事って何だと思う？", "zh": "我当然也考虑过了。桃子觉得，这次来看你们的\n粉丝们，最开心的事情会是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0164_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "07bd02cd3e69b9d9345980eaba0f0c1a33c080e940c7dc9b4adf54cb5fda7c16", "ja": "それは……当然、\nパレードで桃子を見ることじゃないの？", "zh": "那当然是……在巡游上看到桃子吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0164_1017_p", "source_sha256": "3b62676454c3c30dffad68d7611c4e488884e26ff698cd45d71068c6e0721918", "ja": "そのとおり。桃子の笑顔が見たいんだ。だから、桃子が\n自然と笑顔になれる衣装を作ってもらったんだよ。", "zh": "没错。我想看到桃子的笑容。所以，我请人制作了能让桃子自然而然露出笑容的服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0164_1018_049mom", "source_sha256": "73e95389fe5678341707df317ac0bfea3d884288a539536424310f038cd368b4", "ja": "何それ……もう。\nお兄ちゃんのくせに、ちょっと、ナマイキ……。", "zh": "那是什么啊……真是的。\n明明是哥哥，却有点得意忘形……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0164_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "db617cf6497b5313cf84ab3aa12a5a68f81303cfcdc6fcc238dc954b781519b7", "ja": "別に桃子は、この衣装じゃなくても、\nお仕事の時はちゃんと笑顔になれるけど……。", "zh": "桃子就算不穿这套服装，工作的时候也能好好保持笑容……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0164_1020_049mom", "source_sha256": "897a023b212506d862b75d37a8faf89030d3e7dc729b3d2099c5f8c7c2190a9b", "ja": "でも……うん。この衣装なら、桃子、\nずっと笑顔でいられるかも。……だから、ありがと。", "zh": "不过……嗯。穿着这身服装的话，桃子或许就能一直保持笑容了。……所以，谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
